when the \"mixture\" is all saturated vapor - we call this the saturated vapor line.","TaskQuestions":[],"AllowedTools":[],"GrabAllowed":false,"Sets":{"P":159000.0,"V":0.012068,"T":386.0,"Insulation":1.0},"Limits":{"Pressure":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Temperature":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Volume":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"InternalEnergy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Entropy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Enthalpy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Quality":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0}},"TrailSettings":{"IsEnabled":false,"ClearExisting":false,"MaxLength":30},"SecondaryTexts":[],"CorrectIDs":[],"Targets":[]},{"TaskType":5,"InitialConditions":"","TextOnly":"Quality is not defined outside of the vapor dome.","TaskQuestions":[],"AllowedTools":[],"GrabAllowed":false,"Sets":{"P":159000.0,"V":0.012068,"T":386.0,"Insulation":1.0},"Limits":{"Pressure":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Temperature":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Volume":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"InternalEnergy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Entropy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Enthalpy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Quality":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0}},"TrailSettings":{"IsEnabled":false,"ClearExisting":false,"MaxLength":30},"SecondaryTexts":[],"CorrectIDs":[],"Targets":[]},{"TaskType":0,"InitialConditions":"","TextOnly":"","TaskQuestions":["Add heat until quality is approximately x=50%. (Watch System Properties)","Looking inside the cylinder, how much of the volume is occupied by liquid?"],"AllowedTools":[0,1],"GrabAllowed":false,"Sets":{"P":100000.0,"V":0.010413,"T":372.7559,"Insulation":1.0},"Limits":{"Pressure":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Temperature":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Volume":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"InternalEnergy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Entropy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Enthalpy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Quality":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0}},"TrailSettings":{"IsEnabled":false,"ClearExisting":false,"MaxLength":30},"SecondaryTexts":["Less than 10%","About 50%","More than 90%"],"CorrectIDs":[0],"Targets":[]},{"TaskType":5,"InitialConditions":"","TextOnly":"Although quality and volume fraction are related, they are NOT the same.  Volume fraction is easy to understand because we can \"see\" how much volume is liquid or vapor. Because quality is a mass fraction it also depends on the density of the vapor and liquid.\r\n\r\nNote that the ball is close to the saturated vapor line on the 3D plot. This is because the plot is using a logarithmic scale.","TaskQuestions":[],"AllowedTools":[0,1],"GrabAllowed":false,"Sets":{"P":-1.0,"V":-1.0,"T":-1.0,"Insulation":-1.0},"Limits":{"Pressure":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Temperature":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Volume":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"InternalEnergy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Entropy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Enthalpy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Quality":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0}},"TrailSettings":{"IsEnabled":false,"ClearExisting":false,"MaxLength":30},"SecondaryTexts":[],"CorrectIDs":[],"Targets":[]},{"TaskType":3,"InitialConditions":"","TextOnly":"","TaskQuestions":["Use the Burner and cooler to move back and forth. Stay in the two-phase region.","Which of these properties remains constant? (Watch System Properties.) You may select multiple properties."],"AllowedTools":[0,1],"GrabAllowed":false,"Sets":{"P":100000.0,"V":0.010413,"T":372.7559,"Insulation":1.0},"Limits":{"Pressure":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Temperature":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Volume":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"InternalEnergy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Entropy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Enthalpy":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0},"Quality":{"Ceiling":-1.0,"Floor":-1.0}},"TrailSettings":{"IsEnabled":false,"ClearExisting":false,"MaxLength":30},"SecondaryTexts":["Pressure","Volume","Temperature"],"CorrectIDs":[0,2],"Targets":[]},{"TaskType":5,"InitialConditions":"","TextOnly":"Temperature remains constant during this constant pressure proce